s, you=E2=80=99ll continue to build on your project. Everything you create =
during this course can be included in your portfolio. Be sure to take the l=
essons and modules of this course in order, so you'll follow the steps of t=
he design process and create all of the artefacts you=E2=80=99ll need for y=
our portfolio.<br><br><strong>1. Go to </strong><a href=3D"https://fakeclie=
nts.com/ux%EF%BF%BC2" target=3D"_blank" data-turbo=3D"false"><strong>https:=
