rong>. Make sure that 'UX Design' is selected from the dropdown</strong><br=
><strong>3. Click on 'Generate Brief'</strong><br><strong>4. Now you have a=
 generated brief, but you can regenerate it until you find something that s=
parks your interest</strong></p><p style=3D"text-align:left;" class=3D"text=
