at the airport after landing. It's up to you to <strong>choose whether you =
want to solve the problem through a mobile app or website</strong>.</p><p s=
tyle=3D"text-align:left;" class=3D"text-base"><br>Choose just one brief tha=
t you'll work on over the next few modules, so find one that really speaks =
to your interests or experiences. When you find a brief that you like, take=
 a screenshot or write it down. If you already have some project in mind, f=
eel free to work on it instead of generating a project brief.</p></div>
